msgid "By the end of this module, you should be able to:\n"
msgstr "À la fin de ce module, tu devrais être en mesure de :\n"

#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Recognize the benefits of exploring quantum computing now.\n"
msgstr "Reconnaître les avantages d'explorer le calcul quantique dès maintenant.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Identify the industries and applications where quantum computing shows promise.\n"
