#, no-wrap
msgid "Read the IBM report on [“Exploring Quantum Use Cases for Chemicals and Petroleum.”](https://www.ibm.com/downloads/cas/BDGQRXOZ)\n"
msgstr "Lis le rapport IBM sur [« Exploring Quantum Use Cases for Chemicals and Petroleum. »](https://www.ibm.com/downloads/cas/BDGQRXOZ)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
